SUMMARY:Figure Drawing
LOCATION:Studio Two Three\, 109 W 15th St\, Richmond\, VA 23224
DESCRIPTION:3-hour figure drawing workshop with a professional nude model\, poses called by artist Carter Helmandollar. Bring your own drawing/painting/sculpting materials\; extra paper\, pencils and clipboards available.\\n\\nCost: $20\\n\\nRegister: https://www.studiotwothree.org/classes/p/figure-drawing-826
URL:https://www.studiotwothree.org/classes/p/figure-drawing-826
