SUMMARY:Nude Figure Drawing at Unkindness Art
LOCATION:Unkindness Art\, 2923 North Avenue\, Richmond\, VA 23222
DESCRIPTION:Ongoing nude figure drawing series\, open to artists 18 and over. September session is a short pose session with a single model. Tickets required in advance\, nonrefundable. 18+ only\, valid photo ID required at entry.\\n\\nCost: $10.00\\n\\nRegister: https://www.unkindnessart.com/events/nude-figure-drawing-at-unkindness-art
